# In-app updates

`UpdateManager` / `UpdateSelector` / `AppVersion` compare GitHub Release tags. Do not change ordering or prerelease parsing without understanding existing tags (`v0.3.0-pre.N`).

Obtainium installs those same GitHub Releases. Shipping a new APK is the `obtainium-prerelease` skill, not a change to compare logic.
